Package: smartdns-geo-conf
Version: 0.10.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: 0xkee
Depends: keenetic-entware-extras, smartdns, ca-certificates
Description: SmartDNS configuration for DNS splitting by geo-zones on Keenetic/Entware.
 Configurable DNS zones (RU, EAEU, CIS, BRICS, EU, etc.) with per-country
 DNS server presets. International DNS via VPN interfaces (MITM protection).
 Toggle: enable/disable split-DNS. Init: S37smartdns-conf.
Section: net
Priority: optional
